[
  {
    "text": "孩子生气时，你的第一句话，决定他一生的情绪底色。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s01.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "他尖叫、摔东西，不是脾气差，是内心在求救。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s02.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "那些歇斯底里，翻译过来只有一句话：我很难受，但我不知道怎么表达。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s03.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "可我们的第一反应，常常是不许哭，你怎么这么不懂事。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s04.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "火没扑灭，反而把孩子的情绪出口堵死了。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s05.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "真正的引导不是消灭情绪，是教他跟情绪共处。分三步。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s06.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "第一步，孩子炸的时候，你先别炸。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s07.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "深呼吸三次，心里说一句：他不是在闹我，他是在向我求救。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s08.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "你的平静，就是接住他情绪最好的容器。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s09.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "第二步，替他说出他说不出来的话。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s10.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "蹲下来，看着他的眼睛：你现在很生气对不对，因为积木倒了，你搭了好久。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s11.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "情绪一旦被看见、被说破，破坏力就减半。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s12.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "第三步，给情绪一个安全的出口。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s13.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "去阳台吼三声，一起撕掉这张废纸，想打枕头？这个可以打。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s14.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "这不是纵容，是教他：情绪可以来，也可以走，你可以选择怎么送它走。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s15.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "等他平静了，抱抱他，轻声问：刚才生气的时候，你心里是什么感觉？",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s16.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "不评价，不教育，就只听。这份倾听，比讲一百遍大道理都管用。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s17.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "你不是在对付一个问题孩子，你是在陪一个小生命，学会跟自己的情绪冲浪。",
    "voice_id": "zh_female_qinqienvsheng_moon_bigtts",
    "speed_ratio": 1.0,
    "output": "s18.mp3"
  }
]
